== Trivia ==
* This item is used in {{chal|The Tank}} and {{chal|Cursed!}}.
* Yum Heart is the only item that more than 1 character starts with (excluding {{c|Eden}}).
* {{i|Yuck Heart}} is a {{e|Rotten Heart|n}} variation of Yum Heart.
* This item along with any form of healing other than the starting item has no effect in {{chal|Have a Heart}}

